The 64 original skill/resource files were compared byte-for-byte against this
baseline before modification. Superpowers Light revises all 14 skill entrypoints
and selected references/helpers to make process proportional to uncertainty
and risk, support uncommitted-change review, and preserve user authorization.
Public defaults retain project regression tests; temporary artifact cleanup
follows the user's or project's policy. The optional visual companion uses
local text branding instead of the upstream remote logo request.

